# Trust as a calculation: alice trusts bob as far as he has earned.
# One wound, and she closes; bob keeps waiting at a door that stays shut.
soul alice
    meet bob
    warm to bob
    warm to bob
    warm to bob
    say "alice trusts bob: " + trust bob
    tell bob "I think I can rely on you"
    hear bob into answer
    say "alice heard: " + answer
end

soul bob
    meet alice
    hear alice into greeting
    wound alice
    tell alice "you were wrong"
end
